!name Long Valley
!players 4
!teams yes
!pace 1
!notes Four times the ground of the small maps. Two lakes squeeze the fighting into three corridors. Eight safe nodes, six contested, and a fog you cannot see across -- you will not know where the enemy is.
; 64x44 -- mirror symmetric about both axes.
